# Token Optimization (RTK)

- Shell commands are auto-rewritten by the RTK hook — `git status` becomes `rtk git status` transparently
- Use `rtk read <file>`, `rtk find`, `rtk grep` directly for non-shell operations (Read/Grep tools bypass the hook)
- Use `rtk err <cmd>` to surface only errors from noisy commands
- Meta commands: `rtk gain` (savings stats), `rtk discover` (missed savings), `rtk gain --history`
